## How to use on Databricks
- Upload the three files to DBFS at `/dbfs/FileStore/zillow/`:
  - `godenresponsealpha.docx`
  - `buyabilityprofile.rtf`
  - `ZIllow_Fair_Housing_Classifier.docx`
- Attach a cluster with Internet access for `pip install`.
- Run the cells in order.
- Optionally set `OPENAI_API_KEY` at cluster or notebook scope for the Responses API demo.# Optional: Responses API demonstration
